data: {"id":"gen-1794250913-VMCKzxcOm9gWXSVfMHVF","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1794250913,"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","reasoning":"**Assessing Data Extraction Robustness**\n\nI'm now focusing on evaluating the agent's robustness and efficiency in data extraction. I've noted the manual steps for gathering eatery details. The simple `check_operating_hours` function is easily prone to errors, particularly with variations in time formats. Moreover, the lack of automatic extraction from initial search results is inefficient, indicating a dependence on pre-defined lists rather than robust information parsing.\n\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Assessing Data Extraction Robustness**\n\nI'm now focusing on evaluating the agent's robustness and efficiency in data extraction. I've noted the manual steps for gathering eatery details. The simple `check_operating_hours` function is easily prone to errors, particularly with variations in time formats. Moreover, the lack of automatic extraction from initial search results is inefficient, indicating a dependence on pre-defined lists rather than robust information parsing.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

